      en: ["The bay is known for its high salinity and consistently calm sea conditions.", "It is home to the first dedicated \"Wine Resort\" in the Caribbean region.", "The beaches in the bay often feature a unique mix of grey sand and pebbles.", "Significant Taino archaeological sites have been discovered near the bay shores.", "The water temperature remains warm and stable throughout the entire year.", "Ocoa was a vital port for timber exports during the 19th century."],
